& [BuildPlanIdentity] is the dependency-ordered execution plan
  + [plan_uuid] is 7a5120ad-760e-48dc-97fe-7612c22d821e
  + [plan_status] is ReadOnlyLiveCodexAdapter_complete
  + [completed] is Phase0 through Phase6 and CEB-001 through CEB-015
  + [active_phase] is none_between_proven_slices
  + [next_candidate] is Phase3ScopedWrite source selection and SJS only; implementation remains inactive until its narrower branch, effect, review, and rollback authority is signed
  + [implementation_language] is safe Rust edition 2024
  + [initial_workspace] is one Cargo workspace with cantor_core, cantor_cli, and cantor_mcp
  + [work_rule] is implement and prove one contiguous slice before activating its dependent
