  + [decision] is retain in-memory, select an embedded physical backend, or preserve a pluggable boundary
  + [proof] is benchmark inputs, method, results, costs, and migration implications
  + [decision] is retain canonical JSON environment snapshot and request-scoped admitted in-memory SemanticFabric
