& [Phase7RoutingExperiment] is implement CEB-016 through CEB-020 only when activated
  + [depends_on] is deterministic baseline, reviewed routing corpus, stable semantic addresses, explicit metrics, failure threshold, and fallback proof
  + [actions] is train or configure one smallest viable candidate router and bind its artifact digest to fabric and corpus digests
  + [shadow_mode] is compare proposals against deterministic retrieval without granting result authority
  + [adoption] is accept only a material measured gain with zero authority-gate bypass and acceptable regression bounds
  + [rejection] is remove or retain as research when it fails the gate; deterministic operation remains complete

